@startuml 使用案例2_1_個人送養發佈
title 使用案例2.1: 個人送養發佈

actor "一般會員" as User
participant "RehomeForm.vue" as Form
participant "FileUploader.vue" as Uploader
participant "animals.ts" as AnimalAPI
participant "medicalRecords.ts" as MedicalAPI
participant "uploads.py(blueprint)" as UploadAPI
participant "animals.py(blueprint)" as AnimalBlueprint
participant "animal_service.py" as AnimalService
participant "animal.py(model)" as AnimalModel
participant "notification_service.py" as NotificationService
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "MinIO" as Storage

== 1. 進入表單頁面 ==
User -> Form: 點選「發佈送養」
activate Form
Form -> Form: 檢查用戶登入狀態\n(authStore.user)
Form -> Form: 初始化表單資料\n(formData = 空白)

alt 編輯模式 (route.query.id 存在)
    Form -> AnimalAPI: getAnimal(animalId)
    activate AnimalAPI
    AnimalAPI --> Form: animal 資料
    deactivate AnimalAPI
    Form -> Form: 填充表單資料\n檢查權限
    Form --> User: 顯示編輯表單
else 新增模式
    Form -> Form: 檢查 localStorage\n是否有草稿
    Form -> Form: 如有草稿則載入\nloadDraft()
    Form --> User: 顯示空白或草稿表單
end

note right
  收容所會員會顯示提示訊息:
  「您正在進行單次送養操作」
  
  編輯模式: 載入現有動物資料
  新增模式: 嘗試從 localStorage 載入草稿
end note

== 2. 填寫動物基本資訊 (步驟1) ==
User -> Form: 填寫名稱、物種、品種
User -> Form: 選擇性別、出生日期
User -> Form: 填寫顏色、描述
User -> Form: 選擇是否已絕育
note right
  ⚠️ 前端無即時驗證
  只在「下一步」或提交時驗證
  
  草稿儲存: 使用者手動點擊「儲存草稿」
  觸發 saveDraft() 才儲存到 localStorage
end note

== 3. 上傳動物圖片 (步驟2) ==
User -> Form: 點選「下一步」
Form -> Form: 驗證步驟0必填欄位\nif (!name || !species) return
Form -> Form: 切換到圖片上傳步驟\n(currentStep++)
User -> Uploader: 選擇圖片檔案\n(至少1張)
activate Uploader
Uploader -> Uploader: 驗證檔案格式\n(JPG, PNG, GIF)
Uploader -> Uploader: 驗證檔案大小\n(最大5MB)
Uploader -> Uploader: 產生預覽縮圖
Uploader --> Form: 圖片已準備\n(files[])
deactivate Uploader
note right
  圖片尚未上傳到伺服器
  只儲存在客戶端記憶體
end note

== 4. 新增醫療記錄 (步驟3, 選填) ==
User -> Form: 點選「新增醫療記錄」
User -> Form: 填寫記錄類型、日期、提供者
User -> Form: 填寫醫療細節
User -> Uploader: 上傳醫療文件 (選填)
Uploader -> Uploader: 驗證文件格式
Uploader --> Form: 文件已準備
Form -> Form: 將記錄加入暫存\n(tempMedicalRecords[])
note right
  醫療記錄暫存在前端
  提交時才會建立
end note

== 5. 確認並提交 (步驟4) ==
User -> Form: 檢視所有資訊
User -> Form: 點選「發佈送養」
Form -> Form: 驗證必填欄位
Form -> Form: 檢查至少有1張圖片\n(編輯模式可無新圖片)

== 6. 建立/更新動物記錄 (後端) ==

alt 編輯模式 (isEditMode && editingAnimalId)
    Form -> AnimalAPI: updateAnimal(animalId, animalData)
    activate AnimalAPI
    AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: PATCH /animals/{id}\n{動物資料}
    activate AnimalBlueprint
    AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: update_animal(animal_id, user, data)
    activate AnimalService
    AnimalService -> DB: UPDATE animals
    activate DB
    DB --> AnimalService: 更新成功
    deactivate DB
    AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: animal
    deactivate AnimalService
    AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: {animal: {...}}
    deactivate AnimalBlueprint
    AnimalAPI --> Form: animalId
    deactivate AnimalAPI
else 新增模式
    Form -> AnimalAPI: createAnimal(animalData)
    activate AnimalAPI
    AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: POST /animals\n{動物資料}
activate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalBlueprint: 驗證 JWT Token\n取得 current_user_id
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: create_animal(user, data)
activate AnimalService

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 判斷動物歸屬\n(個人送養或收容所)
note right
  若 user.role == SHELTER_MEMBER:
    shelter_id = user.primary_shelter_id
  否則:
    owner_id = user.user_id
end note

AnimalService -> AnimalModel: 建立 Animal 物件
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> AnimalModel: 設定初始狀態 = DRAFT
AnimalModel -> AnimalModel: 驗證 owner_id 與 shelter_id\n互斥條件
AnimalModel -> DB: INSERT INTO animals
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: animal_id
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> AnimalService: animal
deactivate AnimalModel

    AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: animal
    deactivate AnimalService
    AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: {animal: {...}}
    deactivate AnimalBlueprint
    AnimalAPI --> Form: animalId
    deactivate AnimalAPI
end

note right
  ⚠️ 此階段圖片**尚未上傳**
  圖片只儲存在 FileUploader.files[]
  實際上傳發生在 Stage 7
end note

== 7. 上傳圖片 (Step 3) ==

alt 有新照片需上傳 (uploaderFiles.length > 0)
    Form -> Form: 準備上傳圖片檔案\nfiles = fileUploader.files
    Form -> UploadAPI: uploadMultiple(files, 'ANIMAL', animalId)
activate UploadAPI

loop 每張圖片
    UploadAPI -> UploadAPI: 取得預簽章 URL\n(presigned URL)
    UploadAPI -> Storage: PUT 圖片檔案
    activate Storage
    Storage --> UploadAPI: 上傳成功
    deactivate Storage
    UploadAPI -> AnimalAPI: addAnimalImage(animalId, imageData)
    activate AnimalAPI
    AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: POST /animals/{id}/images
    activate AnimalBlueprint
    AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: add_image(...)
    activate AnimalService
    AnimalService -> DB: INSERT INTO animal_images
    activate DB
    DB --> AnimalService: image_id
    deactivate DB
    AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: image
    deactivate AnimalService
    AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: {image: {...}}
    deactivate AnimalBlueprint
    AnimalAPI --> UploadAPI: 圖片已關聯
    deactivate AnimalAPI
end

    UploadAPI --> Form: uploadResults[]
    deactivate UploadAPI
else 無新照片
    note right
      編輯模式: 使用現有照片
      新增模式: 跳過此步驟
    end note
end

== 8. 建立醫療記錄 (Step 3.5, 選填) ==

alt 有暫存的醫療記錄 (tempMedicalRecords.length > 0)
    note right
      醫療記錄暫存在 tempMedicalRecords[]
      此階段才批次建立到資料庫
    end note
    
    loop 每筆暫存的醫療記錄
        alt 有醫療文件附件
            Form -> UploadAPI: uploadMultiple(files, 'MEDICAL_RECORD', animalId)
            activate UploadAPI
            UploadAPI -> Storage: 上傳醫療文件
            Storage --> UploadAPI: 文件 URLs
            UploadAPI --> Form: uploadResults[]
            deactivate UploadAPI
        end
        
        Form -> MedicalAPI: createMedicalRecord(animalId, medicalData)
        activate MedicalAPI
        MedicalAPI -> DB: INSERT INTO medical_records
        activate DB
        DB --> MedicalAPI: record_id
        deactivate DB
        MedicalAPI --> Form: 醫療記錄已建立
        deactivate MedicalAPI
    end
    
    Form -> Form: 清空暫存記錄\ntempMedicalRecords = []
else 無暫存醫療記錄
    note right
      跳過醫療記錄建立
    end note
end

== 9. 提交審核 (Step 4) ==
Form -> AnimalAPI: submitAnimal(animalId)
activate AnimalAPI
AnimalAPI -> AnimalBlueprint: POST /animals/{id}/submit
activate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalBlueprint -> AnimalService: submit_for_review(animalId, user)
activate AnimalService

AnimalService -> AnimalService: 檢查權限\n(擁有者或收容所成員)
AnimalService -> AnimalService: 檢查狀態 = DRAFT
AnimalService -> DB: UPDATE animals\nSET status = 'SUBMITTED'
activate DB
DB --> AnimalService: 更新成功
deactivate DB

note right
  ⚠️ 後端代碼**沒有**通知管理員邏輯
  submit_for_review() 只更新狀態
  不會呼叫 notification_service
  
  管理員需自行查看待審核清單
end note

AnimalService --> AnimalBlueprint: animal (status=SUBMITTED)
deactivate AnimalService
AnimalBlueprint --> AnimalAPI: {animal: {...}}
deactivate AnimalBlueprint
AnimalAPI --> Form: 提交成功
deactivate AnimalAPI

== 10. 完成 ==
Form -> Form: 清除 localStorage 草稿
Form -> Form: 設定成功訊息\n(submissionSuccess = true)
Form --> User: 顯示成功提示\n「送養資訊已建立並提交審核成功!」
deactivate Form

note over User, DB
  **後置條件:**
  1. 動物記錄已建立 (status = SUBMITTED)
  2. 圖片已上傳並關聯
  3. 醫療記錄已建立 (如有)
  4. 草稿已清除
  5. 等待管理員審核
  
  **管理員審核通過後:**
  status: SUBMITTED → PUBLISHED
  公開顯示在領養清單
end note

@enduml
